# Copy to .env and fill in the value. .env is gitignored; .env.example is committed.
#
# A9_PREKEY is the pprpc shared "prekey": a fixed secret hardcoded in the camera
# firmware and the vendor app, shared across all units, used to derive the CTRL /
# discovery AES keys. It is not device-specific. This project does not ship the
# value; it is the same one documented in the public analyses the README references
# (e.g. the FuseTim writeup and github.com/pprpc). Paste that value here.
A9_PREKEY=
